  Docs: https://nextlyhq.com/docs/cli/errors/resolve-file-not-found  (RESOLVE_FILE_NOT_FOUND)"
`;

exports[`each code, as a command ends with it > RESOLVE_LOCK_RELEASED 1`] = `
"✗ The migrate lock was released without resolving the migration.
  Why:  Nothing was written.
  Next: Retry once no other schema operation is running.
  Docs: https://nextlyhq.com/docs/cli/errors/resolve-lock-released  (RESOLVE_LOCK_RELEASED)"
`;

exports[`each code, as a command ends with it > RESOLVE_MODE_REQUIRED 1`] = `
"✗ \`nextly migrate:resolve\` needs exactly one thing to record.
  Why:  It was given none of \`--applied\`, \`--rolled-back\` and \`--failed-cleanup\`.
  Next: Provide exactly one of --applied, --rolled-back, or --failed-cleanup.
  Docs: https://nextlyhq.com/docs/cli/errors/resolve-mode-required  (RESOLVE_MODE_REQUIRED)"
`;

exports[`each code, as a command ends with it > RESOLVE_NOT_APPLIED 1`] = `
"✗ Cannot roll back 20261020_120000_add_posts.sql: no prior applied event exists.
  Why:  \`--rolled-back\` records that an applied migration was undone, and the ledger holds no applied run of this file.
  Next: Run \`nextly migrate:status\` to see the file's state: a file that never ran needs no rollback recorded.
  Docs: https://nextlyhq.com/docs/cli/errors/resolve-not-applied  (RESOLVE_NOT_APPLIED)"
`;

exports[`each code, as a command ends with it > RESOLVE_NOTHING_TO_CLEAN_UP 1`] = `
"✗ No failed or unfinished attempt found for 20261020_120000_add_posts.sql.
  Why:  \`--failed-cleanup\` clears the attempts that failed or recorded no outcome, and this file has none.
  Next: Run \`nextly migrate:status\` to see the file's state; to run it again, use \`nextly migrate\`.
  Docs: https://nextlyhq.com/docs/cli/errors/resolve-nothing-to-clean-up  (RESOLVE_NOTHING_TO_CLEAN_UP)"
`;

exports[`each code, as a command ends with it > RESOLVE_PLUGIN_MODULE 1`] = `
