  Next: Resolve the drift or re-run with --skip-verify.
  Docs: https://nextlyhq.com/docs/cli/errors/resolve-schema-mismatch  (RESOLVE_SCHEMA_MISMATCH)"
`;

exports[`each code, as a command ends with it > RESOLVE_SNAPSHOT_MISSING 1`] = `
"✗ No paired snapshot for 20261020_120000_add_posts.sql; cannot verify.
  Why:  \`--applied\` records a file once the live schema matches the snapshot \`migrate:create\` wrote beside it in \`meta/\`, and this file has none.
